## LỖ HỔNG 6: AN NÓI "100 ĐƠN TRONG 5 NGÀY" → KHÔNG DẠY PROCESS VS EVENT

### DeMarco's Process vs Event Framework:

```
EVENT THINKING (An dạy):
"Mở shop → mời 100 KOC → 100 đơn trong 5 ngày → THÀNH CÔNG!"
→ One-time spike, no compounding, no sustainability

PROCESS THINKING (tinh hoa dạy):

WEEK 1-4: Foundation
├── Day 1-7: Product-market fit validation (10 manual sales, measure NPS)
├── Day 8-14: Unit economics locked (CAC < 1/3 LTV proven)
├── Day 15-21: Acquisition channel tested (organic + paid, which works?)
└── Day 22-28: Retention mechanism built (email sequence, loyalty program)

MONTH 2-3: Flywheel
├── Content → Traffic → Leads → Sales → Reviews → More Traffic
├── Measure: weekly growth rate (not total orders)
├── Target: 10% week-over-week growth = 142x in 12 months
└── Kill criteria: <5% growth for 3 consecutive weeks → pivot

MONTH 4-6: Leverage Shift
├── Hire VA for fulfillment ($400-600/mo VN)
├── Automate: email, KOC outreach, reporting
├── Founder time shifts: 80% execution → 80% strategy
└── Measure: revenue per founder-hour (target: increase 3x every quarter)

MONTH 7-12: Asset Building
├── Customer database becomes ASSET (not just revenue)
├── SOPs become ASSET (can train any new hire in 1 week)
├── Brand reputation becomes ASSET (premium pricing power)
└── Data/analytics become ASSET (competitive intelligence to sell)
```

**Bài học đỉnh cao #6:** "100 đơn trong 5 ngày" = EVENT. Không ai build wealth từ events. Wealth = PROCESS that compounds daily. Mỗi ngày hệ thống tốt hơn 1% = 37x sau 1 năm (1.01^365).

