## CÔNG THỨC HOÀN CHỈNH CHO KINH DOANH BỀN VỮNG

```
ELITE BUSINESS FORMULA:

Step 1: VALIDATE (DeMarco CENTS ≥ 35/50)
├── Control: own platform, not rented
├── Entry: barrier high enough competitors can't copy in 6 months  
├── Need: solve pain people PAY to remove (not nice-to-have)
├── Time: decoupled from your personal hours
└── Scale: serve 10K+ customers without proportional cost increase

Step 2: DESIGN CASH FLOW (Stage0 Operator Mastery)
├── Negative CCC: collect before you pay
├── Prepay structure: annual > monthly
├── Float engineering: use customer money to build assets
├── Profit First: 5% profit, 50% owner, 15% tax, 30% opex
└── Kill criteria: if cash runway < 90 days → emergency mode

Step 3: BUILD LEVERAGE (Naval Hierarchy)
├── Start with labor (unavoidable at beginning)
├── Document everything → SOPs = media leverage
├── Productize repeatable work → code leverage
├── Reinvest profits → capital leverage
└── Measure: revenue per founder-hour (must increase quarterly)

Step 4: PROTECT (Taleb Barbell)
├── 90% safe: service revenue, consulting, proven channels
├── 10% risky: new product, new market, new platform
├── Multi-platform: never >50% revenue from 1 platform
├── Moat building: data that improves with use, switching costs, network effects
└── Monthly death mode audit: "how could this die this month?"

Step 5: COMPOUND (Munger Models)
├── Reinvest in feedback loops that accelerate
├── Kill feedback loops that decelerate
├── Compound knowledge: failure post-mortems → pattern library
├── Compound relationships: each customer → potential referral
└── Compound data: each transaction → better predictions
```

